    turnFlow: '1. Players must match the pips of an open end of the linear layout.\n2. **Drawing**: If you cannot play, you MUST draw tiles from the boneyard one by one until you get a playable tile or the boneyard is empty.\n3. **Stock Limit**: In some traditional Hungarian rules, you cannot draw the very last tile of the boneyard.\n4. **End Game**: Once the boneyard is empty and a player cannot move, they must pass.',
